{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- add a responsive Internet secondary-actions layout policy so Settings / Disconnect / Revoke stack to full width at large text in single-column layouts while preserving the compact default row\n- make secondary-action margins visibility-aware so hidden Settings or Disconnect does not leave a leading gap\n- reapply the connection-panel layout after Internet secondary-action visibility changes, including connected, disconnected, configuration-change, session, and revocation paths\n- retain Nubia P0110/pacific no-Host UI/UX evidence in the established compact format\n\n## Verification\n- `./gradlew --no-daemon :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.ConnectionPanelLayoutPolicyTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.MainActivityTerminalGuidanceContractTest`\n- `./gradlew --no-daemon :app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest`\n- `ANDROID_SERIAL=EP0110PZ0B9110300B ./gradlew --no-daemon :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.class=dev.telemachus.display.ConnectionGuidanceLayoutInstrumentedTest`\n- `ANDROID_SERIAL=EP0110PZ0B9110300B ./gradlew --no-daemon :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.class=dev.telemachus.display.ConnectionGuidanceLayoutInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.ConnectionStateAccessibilityInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.ControlBarLayoutInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.SettingsDialogLayoutInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.InternetControlStateColorsInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.InternetPairingDialogLayoutInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.QRScannerLayoutInstrumentedTest,dev.telemachus.display.GestureShortcutPreferencesInstrumentedTest`\n- `shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS` from the retained evidence directory\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`\n\n## Evidence boundaries\n- Evidence device: Nubia P0110 / pacific / Android 16 / SDK 36 only; this is not Xiaomi 13/fuxi evidence.\n- No macOS Vibe Screen, MacHost, Telemachus GUI, `swift run`, TCC, signing/re-signing, System Settings, Keychain, Screen Recording, Accessibility, or `adb reverse tcp:54321` creation/removal was used.\n- This does not prove Host-backed streaming, real Android/macOS clipboard or file-transfer E2E, LAN/Internet transport, video decode, input forwarding, reconnect timing, latency, soak, Host readiness, native pointer, stylus, controller, iOS, macOS hardware acceptance, or Xiaomi 13/fuxi behavior.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Improved Internet secondary-action layouts for large fonts, narrow screens, and different connection states.\n  - Actions now arrange vertically or horizontally as appropriate, with consistent spacing, sizing, reachability, and touch targets.\n  - Layouts refresh correctly when connection status, settings visibility, orientation, or font scale changes.\n\n- **Documentation**\n  - Added Android UI/UX audit evidence, device metadata, test reports, logs, and verification checksums.\n\n- **Tests**\n  - Expanded responsive layout and accessibility coverage; all recorded tests passed successfully.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","closedAt":"2026-09-07T00:47:36Z","files":[{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/androidTest/java/dev/telemachus/display/ConnectionGuidanceLayoutInstrumentedTest.kt","additions":208,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/main/java/dev/telemachus/display/ClientExperience.kt","additions":46,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/main/java/dev/telemachus/display/ConnectionPanelLayoutApplier.kt","additions":58,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/main/java/dev/telemachus/display/MainActivity.kt","additions":7,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidCli